  "releaseNotes": "'## [10.3.2](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/compare/v10.3.1...v10.3.2) (2026-03-17)\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* Invalid caBundle encoding (double base64) ([#1064](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1064)) ([655277f](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/655277f852b6ac811573a23fd43d09bb173eca38))\n\n### Dependencies\n\n* **core:** update dependency sonaranalyzer.csharp to 10.21.0.135717 ([#1067](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1067)) ([d906934](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/d906934e79d406ec452f609a76a3a79250eb2b14))\n* **core:** update dependency ziggycreatures.fusioncache to 2.6.0 ([#1068](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1068)) ([545f0c4](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/545f0c4aec576c8fbf38c95c032199d6111bde2a))\n* **test:** update dotnet monorepo ([#1063](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1063)) ([62c255b](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/62c255b9e5df1bdac6c3ab028b67db2c8d5ac189))\n* **test:** update dotnet monorepo ([#1066](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1066)) ([9ff82c8](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/9ff82c8cfabc163281a8c955c508750ce700738a))\n'",
